sequenceDiagram
    participant PM as Product Manager
    participant API as Assignment API
    participant Client as Simulated Client
    participant SF as Snowflake Pipeline
    participant Engine as Integrity and Analysis
    participant Controller as Rollout Controller

    PM->>API: Create experiment at 5 percent
    Client->>API: Request variant
    API-->>Client: Stable control or treatment assignment
    Client->>SF: Assignment, exposure and outcome events
    SF->>SF: Validate, deduplicate, model and aggregate
    SF->>Engine: Metric and data-health snapshots
    Engine->>Controller: RAMP, CONTINUE, PAUSE or TERMINATE
    Controller->>API: Apply simulated rollout transition
    Controller-->>PM: Decision with evidence and audit trail
